summary:
A rollerskating chihuahua with a grenade launcher. Jump, blast, explode, survive. Inspired by Unreal Tournament and Bomberman.

A first-person arcade action game about a chihuahua in a spacesuit and rollerskates.
Inspired by Unreal Tournament (DM-Morpheus) and Bomberman on the NES.

You jump, shoot grenades, blow things up, and hunt for corn. The game features:

 double jumps and gravity trampolines;

  a grenade launcher and stationary turrets;

  explosive bombs you can throw right onto enemies;

 a laser-blocking shield (you can’t shoot while it’s on);

  enemies bursting into pieces;

  secrets, ammo, and golden corn to collect.

17 levels, different enemy types, and a final boss.

This isn’t about deep meaning — it’s about jumps, impact, and explosions.

You’re a dog in a spacesuit. That’s all you need to know.

